WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.880
So let's go ahead and shake the bottle, and then I am going to show you that this is a

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:10.680
graduated dropper, which means that you can see that there are quarter, half, three quarter,

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:11.680
and one mil marks.

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:15.920
Now I am going to show you the easiest way to be able to use this dropper, and of course

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:20.520
you can always measure to get the 1.2 according to whatever method is easiest for you.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:25.240
Notice I am going to squeeze the dropper, drop it close to let it sit on the lid, and

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:28.480
then I am going to raise it and you will see it fill the dropper.

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:31.400
And you can see that right towards the top there, and if I move it you can see the level

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:32.400
there.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.280
So again, I am going to repeat that step.

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:39.880
Squeeze, set it right on the top, go ahead and let go, and then of course simply put

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:42.200
that into your favorite beverage and enjoy.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:46.080
That is the simplest method, and you can repeat that every time you use this bottle.

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:46.100
We look forward to hearing your fix success story in the near future.
